{"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/savingandloadingworlds"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds","title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","type":"reference"},{"text":" is a value, so keeping a copy in memory is as simple as assigning it to another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variable. To keep a world beyond the life of your program, such as in a save file, or to send it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"somewhere else, encode it. WorldModule offers two ways to do that:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" saves the components of the types you list each time you take one. It’s the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"quickest way to save a few types, and to compare two worlds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene"},{"text":" saves the components and resources of the types a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry"},{"text":" names, so you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list your types once. A scene can also be spawned into another world as new entities.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both save every entity, live or stale, and the hierarchy ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"},{"type":"text","text":"). Neither saves hooks,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"observers, caches, indexes or change ticks."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Make Your Types Codable","anchor":"Make-Your-Types-Codable","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every component and resource type you save must conform to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":". Swift synthesizes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conformance for most types, so declaring it is usually enough:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["extension Position: Codable, Equatable {}","extension Health: Codable {}","extension Name: Codable {}","","struct Treasury: Resource, Codable { var gold: Int }"]},{"text":"Take a Snapshot","anchor":"Take-a-Snapshot","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with the component types to save. The snapshot is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":", so any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encoder can write it, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World(restoring:)"},{"text":" rebuilds the world from it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var world = World()","let knight = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Knight\"), Health(current: 10))","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.snapshot(Name.self, Health.self))","","let snapshot = try JSONDecoder().decode(WorldSnapshot<Name, Health>.self, from: data)","let restored = World(restoring: snapshot)","print(restored[Health.self, of: knight])","\/\/ Prints \"Health(current: 10)\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Entity handles mean the same in the restored world as in the original, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"knight"},{"type":"text","text":" still names"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the knight. Components of types you didn’t list are left out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When every saved type is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Equatable"},{"type":"text","text":", so is the snapshot. Comparing two snapshots compares the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"worlds they were taken of, which is useful for checking that a replay reproduces a recording:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var recorded = World()","let runner = recorded.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0))","recorded[Position.self, of: runner].x += 1","","var replayed = World()","let replayedRunner = replayed.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0))","replayed[Position.self, of: replayedRunner].x += 1","","print(replayed.snapshot(Position.self) == recorded.snapshot(Position.self))","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"text":"Save Whole Worlds with Scenes","anchor":"Save-Whole-Worlds-with-Scenes","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register the types your program saves in a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":", once, under names of your choosing."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Then "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/scene(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" saves every registered type a world holds. Decoding a scene needs the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same registry, passed in the decoder’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CodingUserInfoKey.typeRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Name.self, named: \"Name\")","try registry.register(Health.self, named: \"Health\")","try registry.register(resource: Treasury.self, named: \"Treasury\")","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Treasury(gold: 250))","let castle = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Castle\"))","let guardian = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Guard\"), Health(current: 12))","try world.addChild(guardian, to: castle)","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.scene(registry))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.typeRegistry] = registry","let restored = World(restoring: try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data))","print(restored.children(of: castle) == [guardian])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(restored.resources[Treasury.self].gold)","\/\/ Prints \"250\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The names identify the types in saved data. Choose names of your own rather than relying on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default, the type’s full name, so that saved data stays readable after you rename a type or its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Save Relations","anchor":"Save-Relations","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene saves the hierarchy without being asked. To save another "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation"},{"type":"text","text":", make it "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and register its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets"},{"type":"text","text":" component:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","extension Likes: Codable {}","","var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Targets<Likes>.self, named: \"Likes\")","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn()","let bob = world.spawn()","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.scene(registry))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.typeRegistry] = registry","let restored = World(restoring: try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data))","print(restored.sources(Likes.self, of: bob) == [alice])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"text":"Spawn Saved Entities into a World","anchor":"Spawn-Saved-Entities-into-a-World","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Restoring a scene replaces a whole world. To add a scene’s entities to an existing world instead,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as you would to place a saved enemy squad or a room of a level, call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(contentsOf:)-7g753","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Each of the scene’s live entities is spawned as a new entity, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the method returns the new entity for each of the scene’s:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Name.self, named: \"Name\")","try registry.register(Health.self, named: \"Health\")","","var prefab = World()","let goblin = prefab.spawn(Name(value: \"Goblin\"), Health(current: 4))","let saved = prefab.scene(registry)","","var world = World()","let first = world.spawn(contentsOf: saved)","let second = world.spawn(contentsOf: saved)","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(first[goblin] == second[goblin])","\/\/ Prints \"false\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Components that store entity handles must point at the new entities, not the scene’s. Relations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the hierarchy are updated for you. Conform your own components that store handles to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"},{"text":" so that ","type":"text"},{"code":"spawn(contentsOf:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can update them too.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Reach Components and Resources by Name","anchor":"Reach-Components-and-Resources-by-Name","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A registry also lets code that knows only names read and write single values: a scripting host"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that exposes components to scripts, a debugger, or an inspector. Read a component with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/component(named:of:in:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which returns it as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" value, and insert one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/insert(componentNamed:into:in:decode:)"},{"type":"text","text":", whose closure decodes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registered type with any decoder:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Health.self, named: \"Health\")","","var world = World()","let goblin = world.spawn(Health(current: 4))","","let health = registry.component(named: \"Health\", of: goblin, in: world)","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(health)","print(String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self))","\/\/ Prints \"{\"current\":4}\"","","let healed = Data(#\"{\"current\": 9}\"#.utf8)","try registry.insert(componentNamed: \"Health\", into: goblin, in: &world) { type in","    try JSONDecoder().decode(type, from: healed)","}","print(world[Health.self, of: goblin].current)","\/\/ Prints \"9\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the name comes from outside your program, use the checked spellings, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/component(checkedNamed:of:in:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which throw a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"name that isn’t registered, a stale entity or a missing value. Resources have the same pair:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/resource(named:in:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/insert(resourceNamed:into:decode:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Save a world’s entities and components, restore them later, and spawn saved groups of entities"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into other worlds."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Scene":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy, and the components and resources of the types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a registry names."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","title":"Scene","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/scene","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistry":{"abstract":[{"text":"A list of the component and resource types that a scene saves, each under a name that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifies it in saved data.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypeRegistry"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","title":"TypeRegistry","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/typeregistry","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypeRegistry"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"type":"topic","title":"World","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A collection of entities, the components they hold, and resources."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/MapEntities":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MapEntities"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/mapentities","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MapEntities"}],"title":"MapEntities","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type whose values name other entities, which can be pointed at different entities."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistry/resource(named:in:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"resource(named:in:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/typeregistry\/resource(named:in:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/resource(named:in:)","abstract":[{"text":"Returns the resource of the type registered under a name.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resource"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Resources","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ResourcesV"},{"text":") -> any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Resource","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule8ResourceP"},{"kind":"text","text":" & "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Codable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7Codablea"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistry/component(checkedNamed:of:in:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/component(checkedNamed:of:in:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/typeregistry\/component(checkednamed:of:in:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"component"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"checkedNamed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"TypeRegistryLookupError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule23TypeRegistryLookupErrorO"},{"text":") -> any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" & ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7Codablea","text":"Codable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"component(checkedNamed:of:in:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the component of the type registered under a name that an entity holds, throwing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an error if there is none."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/WorldSnapshot":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","title":"WorldSnapshot","abstract":[{"text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy and the components of the listed types.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistry/component(named:of:in:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"component(named:of:in:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/typeregistry\/component(named:of:in:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/component(named:of:in:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the component of the type registered under a name that an entity holds."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"component","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"in"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"},{"kind":"text","text":" & "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Codable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7Codablea"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"Relation","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Relation"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes a kind of link from one entity to others.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Relation"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistry/insert(resourceNamed:into:decode:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"insert(resourceNamed:into:decode:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/typeregistry\/insert(resourcenamed:into:decode:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/insert(resourceNamed:into:decode:)","abstract":[{"text":"Decodes a resource of the type registered under a name and inserts it, replacing any of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same type.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"insert"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"resourceNamed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Resources","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ResourcesV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"decode"},{"kind":"text","text":": (any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Decodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Decodable"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistry/insert(componentNamed:into:in:decode:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"insert(componentNamed:into:in:decode:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/typeregistry\/insert(componentnamed:into:in:decode:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry\/insert(componentNamed:into:in:decode:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Decodes a component of the type registered under a name and inserts it into an entity."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"insert"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"componentNamed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"decode","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/scene(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"scene(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule12TypeRegistryV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TypeRegistry"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5SceneV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a scene of the world’s entities, hierarchy, and the components and resources of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the types a registry names."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/scene(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/scene(_:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/TypeRegistryError":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypeRegistryError"}],"url":"\/documentation